# S-044: connect2 with frame_rate_divisor. Each input owns a counter that is post-incremented per processed frame
# (every pass of a repeated frame counts); the input is called when the value before incrementing was 0.
# An input connected later starts with its own counter at 0.
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 4
vconnect2 v a 1 1
vconnect2 v a 2 2
vconnect2 v b 3 3
vconnect2 v b 4 2
vinputs v
vlock v 1 1 0x01
vunlock v
vlock v 1 2 0x02
vunlock v
vlock v 1 3 0x03
vunlock v
vlock v 1 4 0x04
vunlock v
vinputs v
# a new input starts on the next processed frame
vconnect2 v a 5 2
vlock v 1 5 0x05
vunlock v
vlock v 1 6 0x06
vunlock v
# duplicated frames: every pass advances the counters
vlock v 3 7 0x07
vunlock v
vinputs v
vclose v
